experiment h4_A1_shared8:
objective: H4 arm A1 (h4_plan.md, addendum 2026-11-07). Base + projection of the MiMo delta on the 8 residual directions MiMo shares most with NeoHorse (principal vectors of the two 16-dim signature subspaces), alpha 1, all layer matrices.
budgets:
    allow_write = true
    max_modified_weights = 9000000000
steps:
    step subspace_transfer tensors=model.layers.* source=hf_cache/mimo-distill-hf basis=shared:lab/runs/delta_patterns/sig_mimo.pt,lab/runs/delta_patterns/sig_neohorse.pt k=8 alpha=1.0 out=hf_cache/h4/A1-hf
